From 49cc0e9d8f0c1d1cdf87c2bd9ec7e045616d74d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CipherScope <dev@cipherscope.io>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:51:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 46/48] bench: time the whole path of P2MR ML-DSA-44 and
 Schnorr checks

The first veto gate of the M1 design compares one OP_CHECKMLDSA44 check
with one BIP 342 signature check over their whole path, as a block
validates them: VerifyScript on a P2MR input, through the caching
checker that blocks use, from the stack elements to the result. The
cache is never filled, so every check hashes its cache entry, misses,
and verifies, as a block does with signatures it has not seen.

VerifyScriptP2MRMLDSA44 and VerifyScriptP2MRSchnorr run 10,000 single
checks each, cycling through 64 spends with their own keys and messages,
so that -output-json holds the distribution of single checks. The spends
are src/bench/data/p2mr_mldsa44_spends.raw, which
test/util/generate_p2mr_mldsa44_bench_spends.py writes deterministically.
---
 src/bench/CMakeLists.txt                      |   1 +
 src/bench/data/p2mr_mldsa44_spends.raw        | Bin 0 -> 265090 bytes
 src/bench/mldsa44.cpp                         |  61 ++++++++++
 .../generate_p2mr_mldsa44_bench_spends.py     | 106 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 168 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/bench/data/p2mr_mldsa44_spends.raw
 create mode 100644 test/util/generate_p2mr_mldsa44_bench_spends.py

diff --git a/src/bench/CMakeLists.txt b/src/bench/CMakeLists.txt
index 2a6ab64..852fd70 100644
--- a/src/bench/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/bench/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -62,6 +62,7 @@ add_windows_application_manifest(bench_bitcoin)
 include(TargetDataSources)
 target_raw_data_sources(bench_bitcoin NAMESPACE benchmark::data
   data/block413567.raw
+  data/p2mr_mldsa44_spends.raw
 )
 
 target_link_libraries(bench_bitcoin
diff --git a/src/bench/data/p2mr_mldsa44_spends.raw b/src/bench/data/p2mr_mldsa44_spends.raw
new file mode 100644
